title: The Friesland Affair
subtitle: The party's general secretary turns against Moscow's methods.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month = 12 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 8

= The Friesland Affair

Ernst Reuter, who writes as Friesland, was a prisoner of war in Russia and a commissar of the Volga Germans, and since Jena he has been general secretary of the party. He was on the Left in March. He is not any more. He now demands that the party stop taking its decisions from envoys who answer to the Executive in Moscow and not to the German members.

[? if levi_in_party = 0 : Levi has announced that he will publish Rosa Luxemburg's manuscript on the Russian revolution, written in prison in 1918. Friesland is said to be in touch with him. ?][? if levi_in_party = 1 : Levi is in the party still, and Friesland makes no secret of how often they talk. ?] Moscow's people want him removed.

- @remove: Remove him as general secretary.
- @back: Back his demand.
- @censure: Censure him, and keep him.

@remove
subtitle: What happened. Moscow is satisfied, and its money will be a little easier. Friesland will not stay long after this.
on-arrival: {!
Q.friesland_outcome = 1;
Q.moscow_subsidy += 1;
Q.independence -= 6;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 6);
RG.ledger('Ernst Reuter (Friesland) was removed as general secretary for defying the Executive\'s envoys.', 'e21_friesland');
!}

The Central Committee removes Friesland as general secretary. In the new year he will be expelled. He will go to the KAG, and from there, it is said, to the SPD.

@back
subtitle: Independence from Moscow, at the price of some of its money. Zinoviev's answer will be long and cold.
on-arrival: {!
Q.friesland_outcome = 2;
Q.independence += 10;
Q.moscow_subsidy = Math.max(0, Q.moscow_subsidy - 1);
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -10);
RG.ledger('The Zentrale backed its general secretary Friesland against Moscow\'s envoys.', 'e21_friesland');
!}

The Zentrale backs its general secretary, and writes to the Executive that its emissaries will in future be guests of the German party.

@censure
subtitle: He stays in his post, under watch. Everyone knows it is a reprieve.
on-arrival: {!
Q.friesland_outcome = 3;
Q.unity += 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The Central Committee censures Friesland for indiscipline and keeps him in his post.
